:true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122859","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122859.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122859.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Supplement to #109360 and #122981 \r\n\r\nAdds the ability to set random scale and rotation when drawing with nodes in node drawing mode using the UI.\r\n\r\nSince we might have a `ScenePaint3DEditor` in the future, it will need to have similar randomization features to make the tool truly useful for level artists, such as when placing trees or any other objects, so I think this functionality should be added to 2D first.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes [Add the ability to randomize rotation and scale in 2D node drawing mode](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15439)\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/36ca110a-f67e-40e8-b410-e2913bbaf67f\r\n\r\nAI was used when writing some functions, for example `callable_mp(this, &ScenePaint2DEditor::_randomize_settings_pressed).call_deferred()`, since I have never used them inside the C++ api godot\r\n\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122859/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}